(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the implementation of secure User Authentication in PHP: password hashing with Bcrypt/Argon2, password_hash\(\), and password_verify\(\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Storing passwords securely requires one-way cryptographic hashing with adaptive work factors:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Password Storage Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   1. Registration \(Hashing\):) Tj
T*
(   ```php) Tj
T*
(   $password = $_POST['password'];) Tj
T*
(   // Automatically generates a cryptographically secure random salt and applies Bcrypt/Argon2id) Tj
T*
(   $options = ['cost' => 12]; // 2^12 iterations) Tj
T*
(   $hashedPassword = password_hash\($password, PASSWORD_BCRYPT, $options\);) Tj
T*
(   // Store $hashedPassword \(60-char string\) in MySQL VARCHAR\(255\)) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Login Authentication \(Verification\):) Tj
T*
(   ```php) Tj
T*
(   $stmt = $pdo->prepare\('SELECT id, password_hash FROM users WHERE email = :email'\);) Tj
T*
(   $stmt->execute\(['email' => $email]\);) Tj
T*
(   $user = $stmt->fetch\(\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   if \($user && password_verify\($enteredPassword, $user['password_hash']\)\) {) Tj
T*
(   // Password verified successfully! Mitigates timing attacks natively.) Tj
T*
(   session_regenerate_id\(true\); // Prevent session fixation) Tj
T*
(   $_SESSION['user_id'] = $user['id'];) Tj
T*
(   } else {) Tj
T*
(   // Generic error message to prevent user enumeration) Tj
T*
(   $error = 'Invalid email or password.';) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
