T*
(   XPath and XSLT form the query and transformation pipeline for XML documents:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. XPath \(XML Path Language\):) Tj
T*
(   Navigates XML node trees using path expressions:) Tj
T*
(   - `/catalog/book`: Selects all book elements from catalog root.) Tj
T*
(   - `//book[price < 50]`: Selects all books anywhere in document with price < 50.) Tj
T*
(   - `//book/@id`: Selects all 'id' attribute values.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. XSLT \(Extensible Stylesheet Language Transformations\):) Tj
T*
(   Transforms raw XML into formatted HTML tables:) Tj
T*
(   ```xml) Tj
T*
(   <xsl:stylesheet version="1.0" xmlns:xsl="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Transform">) Tj
T*
(   <xsl:template match="/">) Tj
T*
(   <html>) Tj
