(   1. Strict-Transport-Security \(HSTS\):) Tj
T*
(   `Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload`) Tj
T*
(   - Forces browsers to communicate exclusively over HTTPS for the next year, neutralizing) Tj
T*
(   SSL-stripping and downgrade attacks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Content-Security-Policy \(CSP\):) Tj
T*
(   `Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://trusted.cdn.com;`) Tj
T*
(   - Restricts domains permitted to load and execute scripts, shutting down XSS payloads.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. X-Content-Type-Options:) Tj
T*
(   `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`) Tj
T*
(   - Prevents browser from MIME-sniffing files away from the server's declared Content-Type,) Tj
T*
(   preventing image upload scripts from executing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. X-Frame-Options:) Tj
T*
(   `X-Frame-Options: DENY` \(or `SAMEORIGIN`\)) Tj
T*
(   - Completely blocks external sites from framing the page inside an `<iframe>`, preventing) Tj
T*
(   Clickjacking attacks.) Tj
